  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.9 - Major Exchange Implementations (Bithumb, Kraken, Binance, Upbit)\n• New: Complete implementation of 4 major exchanges with all 16 standard API methods\n  - Bithumb (KR): Full JWT authentication, v2.1.0 API support\n  - Kraken (US): Complete implementation with legacy methods support\n  - Binance (Global): World's largest exchange - full spot trading support\n  - Upbit (KR): Complete JWT authentication implementation\n• Features: All exchanges now support:\n  - Market data (orderbook, trades, candles, price)\n  - Trading operations (place/cancel orders, order history)\n  - Account management (balance, account info)\n  - Funding operations (deposits, withdrawals, history)\n• Enhanced: Now supporting 8 fully functional exchanges (up from 4)\n• Documentation: Updated exchange status and implementation guides\nFull changelog: https://github.com/ccxt-net/ccxt.simple/blob/main/docs/CHANGELOG.md",
